  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"6664\" height=\"917\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RJa0x19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cV4cJyGXqF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?color=7289DA&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fglobox1997.github.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fHerdsPanic%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?color=7bc466&amp;label=Globox&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;up_message=Wiki&amp;url=https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/HerdsPanic/\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Globox1997/HerdsPanic/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Globox1997/HerdsPanic?color=c4667b&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\"></p><p>HerdsPanic 是一款简单的模组，旨在为《我的世界》中的动物增添一丝真实感 ;)</p><p>当群体中的一只动物（例如一群牛）受到攻击时，整个群体都会陷入恐慌。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iTrET2i.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"336\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oCrtfsy.gifv\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"fabric-api\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a></p><p>本模组专为 Fabric 开发。</p><p>暂无开发 Forge 版本的计划。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>整合包使用许可：<strong><br></strong></p><p>欢迎在任何整合包中使用本模组。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>漏洞报告：</p><p>请在 GitHub 页面提交漏洞报告。</p>",
